<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Viraat Yadav</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin:0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#22c55e);
      border-bottom-left-radius: 50px;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 50px;
      color: white;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin: 0;
    }
    header p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    section {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #020617;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .profile {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .profile img {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 4px solid #22c55e;
    }
    a { color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; opacity: 0.7; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Viraat Yadav</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my official personal website 🚀</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="card profile">
      <img src="your-photo.jpg" alt="Viraat Yadav Photo">
      <div>
        <h2>मेरे बारे में</h2>
        <p>मैं Viraat Yadav हूँ। यह मेरी personal website है जहाँ आप मेरे बारे में, मेरे काम और मेरी पहचान जान सकते हैं।</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Skills / काम</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Content Creator</li>
        <li>YouTube / Social Media</li>
        <li>Creative Editing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email: yourname@email.com</p>
      <p>Instagram: <a href="#">@viraatyadav</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Viraat Yadav | All Rights Reserved
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
